message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "lumbar-muscle-pro: Scanner-normalized paraspinal and iliopsoas muscle T2 analysis for lumbar decompression recovery"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Pacheco-Barrios"
    given-names: "Niels"
    affiliation: "Department of Neurosurgery, Beth Israel Deaconess Medical Center, Harvard Medical School"
repository-code: "https://github.com/USER/lumbar-muscle-pro"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-08"
keywords:
  - lumbar decompression
  - paraspinal muscle
  - MRI T2 signal
  - PROMIS
  - reproducible research
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis code for a retrospective cohort study of whether
  scanner-normalized preoperative paraspinal and iliopsoas muscle T2 signal
  predicts functional recovery after lumbar decompression. Code-only; no
  patient data are distributed.
